    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_1; @(posedge clk) s_nexttime (disp_ena |-> ((h_cnt < h_pixels) && (v_cnt < v_pixels))); endproperty",
      "explanation": "After every clock update, disp_ena is set only when both updated counters are in the visible region; reset clears it. The one-sample delay avoids assuming initialized counters or outputs."
    },
    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_2; @(posedge clk) (rst || ((h_cnt < h_period - 1) && (v_cnt < v_pixels + v_fp))) |=> (v_sync != $past(v_sync)); endproperty",
